<title>JAPAN: Sanyo Industries - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sanyo Industries - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 14.12		vs	   13.90</p>
<p> Operating    loss 16    million    vs   loss 146    million</p>
<p> Current	   prft 81 million    vs    loss 44    million</p>
<p> Net		  123    million    vs	  154    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.50 yen	  vs	    4.40 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     35 million	  vs	  35 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sanyo Industries Ltd is a general building hardware manufacturer.</p>
</text>
